Hi all!
This device has two stereo line ins and we are unable to control them. They
are at some unchangable predefined level, but in Windows there are four
independent controls of them in Maya44 Mixer. The predefined level of these
inputs is so low that we have to use very high gain on microphones and aux
signals on our mixing console, which probably isn't good for audio quality.
If we used software gain then we would loose audio resolution instead, and
also quality would be lower than using appropriate input levels, especially
if these are not digital controllers of digital gain, but real controls of
preamps that amplify the singal before sending to AD converter.

I attached lsusb -v.

Thank's for all your help!

2011/11/22 Kamil Sobolak <krzakx@gmail.com>

